# Emerson UU Chapel — local WordPress

- **Stack:** Docker Compose in project root; site at http://localhost:8080
- **Active theme:** `emerson-uuchapel` (child of `twentytwentythree`) — layout/branding only
- **Feature plugin:** `emerson-chapel` (`wp-content/plugins/emerson-chapel/`) — keep active; survives a theme switch
  - CSS: `assets/css/custom.css`
  - JS: `assets/js/custom.js` (and sibling scripts)
  - PHP: `emerson-chapel.php`, `inc/*.php`
- **Edit theme chrome in the child theme:**
  - PHP patterns: `patterns/*.php`
  - Block HTML templates: `templates/*.html`, `parts/*.html`
  - Logo images: `assets/images/`
- **Page body HTML** is stored in the database as block markup; export/edit via WP admin Code editor, or WP-CLI `wp post get <id> --field=post_content`
- **Do not edit** third-party plugin `vendor/` trees; site-specific PHP belongs in `emerson-chapel`
- **Refresh:** save file → reload browser (hard refresh if CSS/JS cached; W3 Total Cache may need purge locally)
